# Stage 15 — Full EPUB build (GATE)

Build the full book only after the sample PASSed.

1. Call `publication_lint`. If FAIL, fix the flagged files in chapters/final/,
   frontmatter, or metadata, and re-run until PASS.
2. Call `asset_manifest_check`. Fix any missing/absolute asset references; re-run
   until PASS.
3. Call `build_epub` to produce `output/book.epub` from chapters/final/.
4. Call `epubcheck` on `output/book.epub`. Fix any fatal/error and rebuild.

When publication lint + asset manifest + EPUBCheck all pass and `output/book.epub`
exists, stop for controller validation. Do not modify gate or control state.

Exit condition: output/book.epub exists; lint + assets + EPUBCheck all clean.
